stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> INIT
  INIT --> READY : INIT_DONE (백엔드 준비 끝)
  READY --> RUNNING : COMMAND
  READY --> READY : WATCHDOG_TRIP (대기 중 명령 없음 = 정상)
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : COMMAND
  RUNNING --> FAULT : WATCHDOG_TRIP (50 ms 동안 명령 없음)
  FAULT --> FAULT : WATCHDOG_TRIP
  FAULT --> RECOVERING : COMMAND (명령이 다시 옴)
  RECOVERING --> RECOVERING : COMMAND
  RECOVERING --> FAULT : WATCHDOG_TRIP
  RECOVERING --> READY : RECOVERED (좋은 주기 100번 연속)
  INIT --> INIT : STOP
  READY --> INIT : STOP
  RUNNING --> INIT : STOP
  FAULT --> INIT : STOP
  RECOVERING --> INIT : STOP
